{"seq":1,"slug":"developer-toolbox","title":"开发者工具箱","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-systems","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 开发者工具箱 简介\n\n开发者工具箱聚焦于构建高效、可复现的个人开发环境。一套精心打磨的工具链配置，不仅能节省每次换机或重装系统时的数小时重复劳动，更能在日常编码中通过减少上下文切换和操作摩擦来提升深度工作效率。\n\n本 Hub 适用于具备基础命令行经验的开发者，无论你是刚入行希望建立规范化开发环境的新人，还是已有多年经验希望系统化梳理和优化工作流的资深工程师。\n\n第一章**终端与 Shell 配置**深入讲解现代终端模拟器的选型（Ghostty、Kitty、Alacritty 等）以及 Zsh/Fish Shell 的配置策略，涵盖 Starship 提示符、插件管理器等核心组件的实战配置。\n\n第二章**Dotfiles 管理**系统介绍如何用 Git 对配置文件进行版本控制，对比 GNU Stow、chezmoi、bare repo 等主流方案的优劣与适用场景，并指导编写自动化 bootstrap 脚本实现一键环境搭建。\n\n第三章 **macOS 开发环境**围绕 Homebrew 包管理器展开，从 Formula/Cask 选型、Brewfile 声明式管理，到开发工具链（编译器、运行时版本管理器 mise）的自动化安装，以及 macOS 系统偏好的开发者向调优。\n\n第四章**工作空间效率**探讨窗口管理器（Aerospace、yabai、Raycast）、快捷键体系设计原则、多显示器工作流编排等提升日常操作效率的方法论与工具实践。\n\n推荐学习路径：先从第一章建立终端基础设施，再用第二章的 dotfiles 策略将配置纳入版本控制，第三章补齐系统级工具链，最后通过第四章优化日常操作流。四章内容循序渐进，最终形成一套完整的、可跨设备同步的开发者工作环境。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terminal-shell-setup","title":"终端与 Shell 配置","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/terminal-shell-setup","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"terminal-emulator-selection","title":"终端模拟器选型与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/terminal-shell-setup/terminal-emulator-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"zsh-fish-shell-configuration","title":"Zsh 与 Fish Shell 深度配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/terminal-shell-setup/zsh-fish-shell-configuration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"starship-prompt-terminal-aesthetics","title":"Starship 提示符与终端美化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/terminal-shell-setup/starship-prompt-terminal-aesthetics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"dotfiles-management","title":"Dotfiles 管理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"version-control-strategy","title":"版本控制策略与仓库组织","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/version-control-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cross-device-sync-conditional-config","title":"跨设备同步与条件配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/cross-device-sync-conditional-config"},{"seq":3,"slug":"automated-bootstrap-scripts","title":"自动化 Bootstrap 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/dotfiles-management/automated-bootstrap-scripts"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"macos-dev-environment","title":"macOS 开发环境","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/macos-dev-environment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"homebrew-deep-dive","title":"Homebrew 深度实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/macos-dev-environment/homebrew-deep-dive"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dev-toolchain-automation","title":"开发工具链安装自动化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/macos-dev-environment/dev-toolchain-automation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-preferences-dev-tuning","title":"系统偏好与开发者调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/macos-dev-environment/system-preferences-dev-tuning"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"workspace-productivity","title":"工作空间效率","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"window-manager-selection","title":"窗口管理器选型与配置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/window-manager-selection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keyboard-shortcut-system-design","title":"快捷键体系设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/keyboard-shortcut-system-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-monitor-workflow","title":"多显示器与工作流编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/developer-toolbox/workspace-productivity/multi-monitor-workflow"}]}]}